            },
            {
              "custom": {},
              "name": "x-amz-acl",
              "value": "bucket-owner-full-control"
            },
            {
              "custom": {},
              "name": "x-archive-meta01-description",
              "value": "uri(%3Cdiv%3EI%20purchased%20this%20van%20in%20September%202020%2C%20from%20the%20Ford%20Dealership%20in%20Sanford%20Connecticut.%20The%20vehicle%20was%20modified%20without%20my%20authorization%2C%20I%20believe%20in%20cooperation%20with%20some%20law%20enforcement%20agency.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20have%20been%2C%20and%20am%2C%20the%20target%20of%20harassment%20and%20disablement%20which%20I%20believe%20is%20coordinated%20at%20the%20level%20of%20police%20departments%20(counties)%20wherever%20I%20go.%20Hostile%20environments%20are%20created%20for%20me%2C%20and%20people%20whom%20I%20have%20never%20met%20in%20my%20life%20cooperate%20in%20the%20harassment.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThis%20is%20the%20closest%20video%20I%20have%20to%20evidence.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20camera%20records%20videos%20in%2010%20minutes%20intervals.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EVideo%20LOCK0000.mov%2C%20towards%20the%20end%2C%20shows%20when%20the%20van%20was%20powered%20off%20(this%20happened%20today%20at%2005%3A00%20hrs.%20PST).%20At%20that%20time%2C%20the%20odometer%20showed%20the%20miles%20to%20empty%20as%2028%20gallons.%20Given%20my%20previous%20experiences%2C%20I%20disconnected%20the%20battery%20to%20let%20the%20vehicle's%20computer%20reset.%20When%20I%20reconnected%20the%20battery%20back%20on%2C%20which%20is%20at%20the%20beginning%20of%20video%20LOCK0001.mov%2C%20the%20odometer%20showed%201%20mile%20to%20empty%20(at%2005%3A02%20hrs.%20PST)%2C%20and%20when%20I%20tried%20to%20power%20the%20van%20back%20on%2C%20it%20would%20start%20for%20a%20few%20seconds%20and%20then%20power%20off.%20I%20was%20able%20to%20move%20the%20car%20to%20the%20nearest%20parking%20spot%2C%20and%20I%20powered%20the%20van%20for%20about%2040%20minutes.%20I%20began%20to%20record%20the%20first%20video%2C%20after%20a%20police%20car%20passed%20by%20in%20the%20northbound%20280%20freeway.%20Before%20that%2C%20a%20county%20employee%20had%20harassed%20me%20with%20the%20high%20beams%20of%20his%20work%20vehicle%20while%20I%20was%20parked%20at%20the%20commuters%20parking%20lot%20off%20the%20280%20over%20Woodside%20Rd.%2C%20and%20to%20get%20even%2C%20I%20pointed%20my%20handheld%20mega%20flashlight%20at%20his%20face.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAt%2005%3A50%20hrs.%20PST%2C%20(video%20LOCK0002.mov)%20I%20powered%20the%20van%20on%2C%20and%20as%20I%20expected%2C%20the%20odometer%20showed%2027%20miles%20to%20empty.%20I%20was%20able%20to%20power%20the%20van%20back%20on%20and%20drive%20to%20the%20public%20library.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThis%20is%20one%20of%20the%20symptoms%20I%20have%20experience%20since%20I%20bought%20this%20van.%20First%20in%20Washington%20when%20like%20an%20idiot%2C%20I%20drove%20there%20to%20speak%20to%20the%20FBI%20(are%20you%20laughing%20already%3F%20I%20am...%20what%20an%20idiot%20I%20was.%20Asking%20for%20help%20from%20the%20FBI)%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThere%20are%20other%20symptoms%2C%20but%20this%20is%20the%20first%20time%20I%20was%20able%20to%20capture%20a%20video%20when%20the%20van%20was%20powered%20off.%20Right%20now%2C%20I%20am%20preparing%20a%20law%20suit%20again%20Verizon%2C%20who%20cooperated%20to%20the%20hacking%20of%20a%20new%20iPhone%2016%20Pro%20when%20I%20took%20it%20to%20the%20store%20in%20Almaden%20Rd.%20to%20activate%20the%20service.%20You%20can%20read%20descriptions%20of%20the%20screen%20recordings%20I%20am%20preparing%2C%20the%20EXHIBIT%20INDEX%2C%20here%26nbsp%3Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fcybertrapped3%2FHackediPhone16Pro%2Fblob%2Fmain%2FTXT%2FEXHIBIT%2520INDEX%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20believe%20the%20police%20coordinates%20harassment%20at%20the%20community%20level%2C%26nbsp%3B%20in%20a%20way%20that%20even%20people%20who%20don't%20know%20me%20are%20hostile.%20When%20I%20moved%20to%20a%20place%2C%20my%20behavior%20is%20observed.%20I%20am%20tested%20y%20several%20odd%20events%2C%20and%20this%20is%20when%20I%20the%20leaders%20of%20the%20conspiracy%20evaluate%20what%20bothers%20me.%20hen%2C%20whatever%20I%20reacted%20to%20with%20aversion%2C%20that%20is%20what%20many%20many%20members%20of%20the%20community%2C%20even%20through%20work%2C%20will%20behave%20like.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20pointing%20of%20the%20smart%20phone's%20back%20cameras%20and%20the%20use%20of%20high%20bean%20headlights%20by%20vehicles%20is%20a%20common%20ocurrecnce.%20County%20vehicles%20like%20garbagge%20collectors%2C%20and%20earlier%20today%2C%20the%20county%20black%20man%20who%20had%20two%20porter%20potties%20in%20the%20back.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20am%20uploading%20these%20videos%2C%20to%20help%20humanity%20put%20together%20more%20pieces%20of%20the%20puzzle%20having%20to%20do%20with%20government%20sponsored%20harassment%20and%20disablement.%20Hopefully%20these%20videos%20are%20truly%20archived%20for%20future%20generations.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EP.S.%20I%20remember%20I%20first%20connected%20the%20van%20while%20the%20first%20video%20was%20still%20recording%2C%20but%20now%20it%20appears%20that%20it%20was%20in%20the%20second%20video.%20I%26nbsp%3B%20have%20to%20rely%20in%20public%20computers%20from%20the%20public%20library%20because%20as%20you%20can%20imagine%2C%20all%20of%20my%20technology%20is%20horribly%20hacked%20and%20rendered%20useless%20for%20the%20most%20part.%20So%20the%20video%20would%20have%20very%20well%20been%20modified%20by%20these%20dirtbags%20in%20upload.%20I%20am%20using%20a%20microSDC%20card%20with%20the%20SD%20Card%20adapter%20on%20locked%2C%20but%20I%20given%20an%20experience%20in%20the%20Cupertino%20SCCLD.ORG%20branch%2C%20I%20know%20the%20locked%20in%20the%20adapter%20means%20shit.%20So%20keep%20in%20mind%20the%20videos%20could%20have%20been%20modified%20(I%20remember%20I%20connected%20the%20battery%20back%20on%20during%20the%20first%20video).%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fdiv%3E2020%20Ford%20Transit%20250%20with%20Unauthorized%20Modifications%20Purchased%20New%20in%20Ford%20Stanford%20Connecticut%20Was%20Remotely%20Powered%20Off%20While%20in%20San%20Mateo%20County.%3Cdiv%3E%3Cbr%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERight%20now%2C%20as%20I%20upload%20this%2C%20the%20webpage%20has%20this%20message%20on%20top%20%22%3Cstrong%20style%3D%22box-sizing%3A%20border-box%3B%20font-weight%3A%20bold%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(44%2C%2044%2C%2044)%3B%20font-family%3A%20%26quot%3BHelvetica%20Neue%26quot%3B%2C%20Helvetica%2C%20Arial%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2014px%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(248%2C%20241%2C%20236)%3B%22%3EWe%20are%20currently%20experiencing%20delays%20processing%20uploaded%20items.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%22color%3A%20rgb(44%2C%2044%2C%2044)%3B%20font-family%3A%20%26quot%3BHelvetica%20Neue%26quot%3B%2C%20Helvetica%2C%20Arial%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2014px%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(248%2C%20241%2C%20236)%3B%22%3E%20In%20some%20cases%2C%20it%20may%20take%20a%20few%20days.%20We%20apologize%20for%20any%20inconvenience%20and%20appreciate%20your%20patience%20while%20we%20restore%20normal%20functionality.%3C%2Fspan%3E%22%20From%20my%20perspective%2C%20this%20just%20goes%20to%20show%20you%20how%20far%20this%20dirtbags%20go%20to%20try%20to%20turn%20a%20person%20into%20a%20criminal%20or%20a%20person%20with%20%22mental%20health%20issues.%22%20This%20dirtbags%20are%20but%20a%20cesspool%20of%20vermin.%3C%2Fdiv%3E)"
            },
